        <mxCell id="2-34" value="Recovery: a successful transfer with a lost completion response can use Confirm upload. Original completion does not wait for processing.&lt;br&gt;Admission: minimum 20 bytes; images ≤8192 × 4096; panorama exactly 2:1. No automatic resumable/chunked upload workflow." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontColor=#183153;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=14;spacing=12;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
