        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="4-26" value="Save rules: transforms/navigation/layout edits can invalidate old start views; relevant edits disable external bakes until reviewed.&lt;br&gt;Unpublishing blocks new public reads/signing but cannot revoke downloaded bytes or issued GET URLs before their 15-minute expiry.&lt;br&gt;Metadata deletion is not comprehensive storage garbage collection. Builder authentication and physical-device acceptance remain pending." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontColor=#183153;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=14;spacing=12;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
